activation	Print prompt	2026-08-24T16:43:59.8788953Z 
activation	Print prompt	2026-08-24T16:43:59.8789406Z For multiple or complex arguments, pipe a JSON object on stdin using `.` as the sentinel:
activation	Print prompt	2026-08-24T16:43:59.8790198Z ```bash
